    <!-- Consent -->
    <string name="consent_title">Before you start</string>
    <string name="consent_body" formatted="false">Kids Lock is a parental tool. To work, it uses the front camera in the background every few seconds while the screen is on, to estimate whether the person using the phone is a child.\n\n• Camera images are processed only on this phone. They are never saved or sent anywhere.\n• Only the device ID, phone model and app version are sent to our server to check your trial or license.\n• Age estimation by AI is not 100% accurate: it can lock an adult or miss a child, especially teenagers. Always keep your PIN safe.\n• Only install this on a phone you own or manage as the parent or guardian.\n\nBy continuing, you confirm you are an adult and agree to the Privacy Policy.</string>
    <string name="consent_accept">I agree</string>
